ents/4119884651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117793#issuecomment-4119884651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117793","id":4119884651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71kHNr","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T17:02:25Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T17:05:10Z","body":"Cannot reproduce.\nThe external editor setting `text_editor/external/use_external_editor` is normally only available through Editor Settings, not Project Settings and the category doesn't get removed.\nAnd if you override the external editor setting per project, then it is available in Project Settings in the Editor Overrides section even after a restart.\n\nI don't think there is anything special about this setting that would cause this either.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4119884651/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://