69,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBNJd8Q","user":{"login":"Neragoth","id":15939383,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTM5Mzgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15939383?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neragoth","html_url":"https://github.com/Neragoth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neragoth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neragoth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neragoth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neragoth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neragoth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neragoth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neragoth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neragoth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neragoth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T01:25:01Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T01:25:01Z","body":"@gcopeland \n\nI had a very similar issue : `text_editor/external/use_external_editor = true` kept disappearing from `editor_settings-4.6.tres` after restarting Godot, which disabled the external editor again.\n\nIn my case, the problem was caused by an add-on, not by the settings file itself. The culprit was the JetBrains Rider External Editor add-on. Disabling/removing it fixed the issue.\n\nSo this might be worth checking for others affected by this bug: look for editor/IDE integration add-ons that may be rewriting the external editor settings.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4375862769/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4381152068","html_url":